<title>POLAND: Stalexport wins $16 mln Iran contracts.</title>
<headline>Stalexport wins $16 mln Iran contracts.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish steel trader Stalexport SA has signed two contracts worth a total of $16 million to export several dozen thousand tonnes of steel pieces to Iran, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Stalexport will complete the shipments in this year's first quarter, the statement said, giving no other details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
